 s\, cont.\nJohann David Heinichen Pastorale per la Notte di Natale\, S.242 
 -  5 Min\n2.2.0.1\, strings\, continuo\nChristoph Graupner - Ouvertüren-Sui
 te D-Dur GWV 421 - ca. 12 Min -Ausschnitte-\n2 trumpets\, timpani\, strings
 \, continuo\nJohann Stamitz - Sinfonia Pastorale in D major\, Op. 4\, No. 2
  - 14 min\n2 Ob.\, 2 Hr.\, Str.\, cont. - I. Presto\, II. Larghetto\, III. 
 Minuetto\, IV. Presto\, \nMily Balakirev - Ouverture on 3 Russian Themes No
 .1 - 8 min\n2.2.2.2 - 2.2.3.0 - Pk.\, Perc.\, Str.\nAlexander Scriabin - Re
 verie\, for orchestra in E Major\, Op. 24 - 4 min\n2.2.2.2 -4.2.3.0(statt1)
  - Pk.\, Str.\nP.I.Tschaikowsky - Snegurotschka Op. 12 - 16 min\nreduzierte
  Fassung: 3.2.2.2 - 4.2.3.0 - Schlagw.(triangle\, tambourine\, side drum\, 
 cymbals\, bass drum)\, Pk.\, Hrf\, Streicher \n Weihnachtslieder zum Mitsin
 gen\nStr:7.5.4.3.2\nDieter Klug – Dirigent
